#: scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62ae4f5abf7ddaebb2445b7fa27e9272e0c94ae3cb17d3a019318ce60928f9e1
#. default-sha256: 9a6a4f453d6d4a6df16e85cee9d49907d233db668f14fc4eeb4f5032ec25ab21
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Several days passed by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Passarono diversi giorni."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a217cafcd5e273a390f8e04a18cf16592c1603bf69b5170a520076627b0a1698
#. default-sha256: 40f485f513b3bdb4920b0d2d368a438668f05586750bbe8fd6a729b1b6927131
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As Bestia began to act more like a person, the mansion followed suit, slowly becoming more "
"habitable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not yet back to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non appena Bestia iniziò a comportarsi più come una persona,⟪k:1⟫la villa seguì il suo "
"esempio, diventando mano a mano più abitabile—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫sebbene non fosse ancora tornata "
"alla sua antica gloria."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cc7db7c0fdf7e73afaa619894b16d3620ba838ece7160b29552ccb53c95670
#. default-sha256: f090dccc1660d779f548080dd7abd81b86fb0d372b5bad5e904649503c4ea519
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No flowers grew in the garden, but neither were there weeds infesting it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il giardino era privo di fiori che crescevano al suo interno,⟪k:1⟫ma non era nemmeno "
"infestato da erbacce."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9ce0d2937f7eef8bf78c53244e33300b2b5e61abd3c2461ad7f737674d27bc2
#. default-sha256: 9458d31ebd6833da09456a68f9700300752353390204eee0249e472cafc03288
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The dusty corridors, shattered windows, rust-covered kitchen gradually returned to their "
"proper states."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I corridoi polverosi, le finestre in frantumi, la cucina arrugginita—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ogni "
"cosa tornò gradualmente in condizioni più appropriate."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3825633afd02ca51a64e97b0839fd8485bf4a65e0da735452f5a07f1a759a78
#. default-sha256: 407b613174b29f115e38b5cafb9c9f7da1af47cb6f3136a7027597bb38d0460f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia learned how to change his own clothes, and how to draw a bath."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bestia imparò a cambiarsi i vestiti e a farsi il bagno."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e44dcfb8611eb1a93ea98eed9ef3c64d37ec4e716a3cf003e322c45becae9ab1
#. default-sha256: 95b528f0faecde70e37497e9657e8523ed77e56133373d6cd030e5ec3515daf2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer did I have to wait on him hand and foot; he could take care of a number of things "
"all by himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avevo più bisogno di servirlo e riverirlo;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫era in grado di occuparsi di molte "
"cose tutto da solo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be5d2cd1434bef7b8fbd546cc908b0473d5858130043d5f292c9eced87f09c58
#. default-sha256: d285b9ff0fccac3f8534e1277b34e00d8a88009f51109a1585727b0bc8bad3d6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What we lacked for food, he acquired from the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il cibo che ci serviva lo prendeva dalla foresta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331113f889db377ec7b95320f72b63d4f112ea1d246d67cb75bde1983a028c1a
#. default-sha256: f08448edb84c412e792cc4def6baa4845e0fbcdb7729efa70b4f4a440310021a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Never did he go to purchase supplies from the village; rather, he captured hares and "
"gathered herbs hidden in the overgrowth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non andò mai a scambiare il mobilio al villaggio; piuttosto, catturava lepri e raccoglieva "
"erbe nascoste nella folta vegetazione."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6930d5469d8ca437e33c5069be5a468305abca4eb20096b2b72d938e10e9c68f
#. default-sha256: ce64f62644efb49e1236f221597d9afc754e0887cb00c5c159eb80066f445f1f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were days without incident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Erano giorni privi di incidenti."

#: scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55c74694b2623c089f58e521d6e01f7e608a95e5367b7beaf5640135bf5e2058
#. default-sha256: 49fd341d7ca0879e06a44df98d7f1d0de2f5e1d0b1682f277f791420da8b9c1c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And though such a life may be want for excitement,⟪k:1⟫peace is something that you mustn’t "
"take for granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E per quanto una vita simile possa sembrare noiosa,⟪k:1⟫la pace è qualcosa che non si deve "
"mai dare per scontata."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52aae2e3135252df333b5c4e99994172c62121a93f7d4ee6e94e4f982fed863e
#. default-sha256: e50aef8e6da9e6c6f572dc372edb65b4ee11a497a47ba13c4aa84e2f2b12c4ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those who have it cast it aside, finding the leisurely flow of time dull.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Only "
"those who have never experienced it truly know how precious it is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Coloro che la mettono da parte, trovano tedioso il lento scorrere del tempo.⟪k:1⟫ Soltanto "
"coloro che non l’hanno mai provata sanno davvero quanto sia preziosa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80c7e830ca0d4a9f563b02de9bc956b70fb7ec15d34b854e017cf912a2724bbc
#. default-sha256: f09919f4deaa294f4ab852f4ecf1f8e0fe6907b7605ec3cbd709ba65f4beae4c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia appeared to be content.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He wore an expression of solitary serenity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bestia sembrava contento.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nella sua solitudine, aveva un’espressione serena."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9011e2d4c523900fe54ecf9204963c252ebf894cf548f10967481f102d830634
#. default-sha256: ca1eeb241300108dda6a8fcdbc032d9c5ff0e47df080cd9ff0f3c0fbd764e874
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is anyone there?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vi prego...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’è qualcuno in casa?!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 022f943e4ed5e327f0ea088670d00af1c42aa7cb156df7317ecb379b4d076f4c
#. default-sha256: 6d13da2016f7e252dd582023a1eda13e158089588918cfc7aaec01f07e77c737
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, a crack formed in the uneventful tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E poi, un giorno, una crepa si formò in quella quiete priva di eventi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 227442092b58c5698ce9b51f6e618cec7284002cac9007b0787373a74dc48300
#. default-sha256: e619ea9a842906d99a38f2b80016250f503bdb608ed1406dafd10f00b11fa793
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Is anyone... ⟪k:1⟫in there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you part with some food?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t need "
"much..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’è... ⟪k:1⟫C’è qualcuno?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Potete offrirmi un po’ di cibo?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non mi serve "
"molto..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ae1475a16da169ce4de8f779b20639aa772982c056b66933d9f25153aeba58f
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e43720842fb53d909be8cb69b11658fc3efa799678337959f0ab856862f5eb1
#. default-sha256: ce827fc30455c228c6daa13a8ab0e8df1d678cd925237dae9de93347430a29a4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Some food and water...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just a little... ⟪k:4⟫that’s all I need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Solo del cibo e dell’acqua...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vi chiedo poco... ⟪k:4⟫non mi serve altro."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49062049faf87ec4f2f79dddbdf5e0bc8ed9824d54c73e05071b3c2f04695886
#. default-sha256: efbe62aafd47cc7bc9c168a11790934fc714b98a85509d50a0617198f0788811
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia looked over at me, as if seeking my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bestia mi guardò, come se cercasse il mio aiuto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 523960e0608d6b75eb2445db9f2d10583af7dd1eedbc2fbb0c94b1fc5caaca28
#. default-sha256: f985c476ca9ad1e190089a9130daaa1037cc606beed9d4f04f89fe716eb8e4ba
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ironic, no? It was the visitor who was truly in need of aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ironico, no? Era il visitatore ad averne reale bisogno."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1936fbc5a4e3cdb7e4beef9b24574c6634ef2fc0386514578c46f0271c0072c
#. default-sha256: f59e2dea4671869b6731b7db7eea3f6e48b59e367ba6fee3d200dffb58c13b53
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I pondered it for a few moments, deciding that I could not simply turn away someone calling "
"upon the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi presi qualche momento per riflettere, per poi giungere alla conclusione che non potevo "
"mandare via qualcuno che aveva bussato alle porte della villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b82e1723bdf355ac4d65edcda5f1120e980e005475271f8745e2377bdc1030ef
#. default-sha256: 946c9022180d55df24b5be310afd4a5d834fca569c07d51f53e04d7333d65fe2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Bestia ordered me to not let him in, I would have followed his instructions, but he said "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se Bestia mi avesse ordinato di non farlo entrare, avrei seguito le sue istruzioni, ma non "
"disse nulla."

#: scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a41e66b0a85fe989626e70023c36df5f48b5d93720099a1843495badac8e02f6
#. default-sha256: 0ebab14ebdc8552dc81b79e4e8b0f1d5f00ceff3e110f2a1932a427c58e056cd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, thank God... ⟪k:9⟫someone’s here.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I "
"was afraid it was deserted..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, grazie a Dio... ⟪k:9⟫quindi ⟪k:10⟫c’è⟪k:11⟫ "
"qualcuno qui.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Ho avuto paura che questa dimora fosse abbandonata..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e32e26a414510192fc4ce381540d3376f194f9ae285f64544cc5fb132388bf1
#. default-sha256: ebda9999a62b49beaf302007251b6f277e3362fb7fbea1a08b8d56746d664013
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said you were in need of sustenance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ha detto di aver bisogno di nutrimento?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ba395297b91118518abc10ac28eb54b3152a236b479c5ace0958a956eee916b
#. default-sha256: 3df76e642151c14e996031290d2de22430d68946d4481d9ef395ff8d163f2769
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It doesn’t have to be much.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything to quench this thirst..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Sì...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non mi serve molto.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Qualunque cosa possa saziare questa "
"sete..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 701cd63013360ff65f545a67ec2436405056ba63e6176ba259bbd005d186da03
#. default-sha256: 49c063ad3cb0ff71989b0cece7be99ca6cf29ac5ef6d222f283c9c699abfbaa6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I got lost, and it’s been several days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi sono perso da diversi giorni..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2906cdf8d29a8ffcad5222365e517d4f080c25f8d69880ab06772f4bf0845c3b
#. default-sha256: 888962b2b665375810dfee6b710d1c058a94cf8a32de919d8c5bf30ca9e2b434
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Give me a few minutes, I will find—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi dia qualche minuto, vado a cercare—"

#: scenario2:scenario2_AC9BD4EF_8269_46C5_995F_F13494636F77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd7e797963625b8ead5cd67c9fb83d204f340959c57efa950fb7a63427e3f2ce
