msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“That’s just how it works,” the Merchant said, a sorrowful look on his face. He was quite "
"clearly putting on a show, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ così che funziona”, disse il Mercante, con un’espressione afflitta.⟪k:3⟫Ma la "
"sua era chiaramente una recita."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2C716365_FA07_45B4_B3AD_CC0F5DED57F2
